    "type": "tab",
    "label": "Camera picture to WhatsApp",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Sends a picture from a camera snapshot address when something moves."
  },
  {
    "id": "d1b2c3d4e5f60002",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "d1b2c3d4e5f60001",
    "name": "Setup",
    "info": "Before you run this flow: open the Turbo Notify account node, paste an API key (it needs the messages:send scope) and press Test. Replace +12025550123 with the number that should receive the message. Your Turbo Notify account needs a WhatsApp number linked to it. The picture is fetched by Turbo Notify from a public http or https address, so the snapshot address must be reachable from the internet. Replace the example address with your camera's snapshot URL.",
